  "review": {
    "root": "Root identified selected-robots404 and uncertainty-before-validation gaps; both reproduced failing-before and repaired.",
    "independent": "Read-only peer found nested tagged-unit decoder gap; reproduced and repaired. Peer then reported no remaining concrete blocker, matched all 12 source and 115 preservation identities, and did not execute tests/network.",
    "final_manifest_sha256": "b1af0ae9ea13f9d1d070c8685287598833b3d00f0c3b1bed338e10e9e2b15a4e",
    "sorted_path_nul_sha_nul_aggregate": "58e59f860033ca201693ba026df59d40ae1973879c8cdf08df099b308ebafa76"
  },
  "implemented_coverage": [
    "Fresh-only cfg(test) queue and separate experimental namespace; ordinary startup and legacy catalogue exclusion.",
    "Canonical shared charges before tickets; exact per-host robots and ordered selected access; 50 attempts and lower/zero quotas.",
    "Hash-bound review/decision, idempotent acknowledgment recovery, explicit new lease/generation after decision and fixed first deadline.",
    "Complete stopped/cancelled response retention without text promotion, raw backward-clock samples, anchored owned stop and failure precedence.",
    "Quarantine before every fallible observation operation after lifetime binding; publication-only exact retry and stale ownership refusal.",
    "Original/acquisition/journal/profile/clock and raw duplicate/unknown-field tampering refusal.",
    "SQLite trigger rollback, bounded derivative failure, same-body access/content purpose independence, no access text/frontier and no second crawler.",
    "Canonical reopen, partial/final backup/restore and unchanged original bytes."
  ],
  "outcomes": {
    "synthetic_store_increment_verified": true,
    "public_command_added": false,
    "normal_native_collection_enabled": false,
    "network_requests_executed": false,
    "native_campaign_executed": false,
    "coordinator_adapter_implemented": false,
    "benchmark_run": false,
    "independent_relevance_labels": null,
    "release_acceptance": false
  },
  "limits": [
    "Private queue does not exist in production builds. No v1-v4 serialization/reader meaning, public schema, frozen benchmark or runtime activation is changed.",
    "Store calls remain synchronous bounded replay/original I/O/seed interpretation; no latency, hard memory or cooperative parser cancellation claim.",
    "Only canonical wall deadline is covered; a future coordinator must preserve the first in-process monotonic segment across analyst wait.",
    "Caller retains pending Observation; no owning adapter, actual network operation or automatic retry is implemented.",
    "Global Evidence can receive text through a later independently allowed same-body Seed. General Search membership must be acquisition-scoped; this source does not add a purpose-aware corpus selector.",
    "Synthetic access decisions are not real publisher permission. First-content-seed frozen policy clarification remains pending, no preload-scoring/cold campaign/ranked UI evidence exists.",
    "Host Rust checks do not establish native Windows/Mac transport or cross-platform release acceptance."
  ],
